      "source_text": "import TGLExt.V351ModularFixedVectors\n#check TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaImaginaryPower_fixed_of_fixed_pair\n#print axioms TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaImaginaryPower_fixed_of_fixed_pair\n#check TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_square_modular_fixed\n#print axioms TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_square_modular_fixed\n",
      "stream_text": "TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaImaginaryPower_fixed_of_fixed_pair (P : TGLExt.SiteProfile)\n  (x : ↥(TGLV350.Regular.ScalarGNSHilbert P)) (hS : x ∈ TGLV350.Regular.scalarClosedTomitaDomain P)\n  (hF : x ∈ TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaAdjointDomain P) (hxS : (TGLV350.Regular.scalarClosedTomita P) ⟨x, hS⟩ = x)\n  (hxF : ↑(TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaAdjoint P) ⟨x, hF⟩ = x) (t : ℝ) :\n  (TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaImaginaryPower P t) x = x\n'TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaImaginaryPower_fixed_of_fixed_pair' depends on axioms: [propext,\n Classical.choice,\n Quot.sound]\nTGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_square_modular_fixed (P : TGLExt.SiteProfile) (δ : ℝ) (hδ : 0 < δ) :\n  ∃ A,\n    ↑↑A = star (TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage P δ) * TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage P δ ∧\n      ∀ (t : ℝ),\n        (TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaImaginaryPower P t) (TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A) =\n          TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A\n'TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_square_modular_fixed' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n"
    },
